[Audio:falling-tone:Falling Tone]
Played by #R$B934 from the template at #R$B965.
Seven notes of falling pitch, each played #N$08 times.

#AUDIO0(falling-tone.wav)(#INCLUDE(FallingTone))

In the game each note is played on a separate pass of the main loop, so the
notes are further apart than they are here.

